  "description": "His first impression of Seo Ido came down to just three things: A homo, a thug, and a total slut.\n\nSeonwoo starts a part-time job at the Judo Department’s fitness center. There, he crosses paths with star athlete Seo Ido, who only glares at him for no apparent reason—eventually getting Seonwoo fired over it.\n\nAfter losing his job in a single day just because he makes Seo Ido “uncomfortable,” Seonwoo approaches him to clear up the misunderstanding, only to be met with a cold shoulder.\n\n*“We’re complete strangers. So I’d appreciate it if you didn’t call me hyung.”*\n\nWhy the hell does he hate me so much?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/p_hate)",
